          "disambiguationNote": "Zebadiah (A son of Asahel, Joab's brother (1 Chronicles 27:7). A Levite who took part as one of the teachers in the system of national education instituted by Jehoshaphat (2 Chronicles 17:7–8). The son of Ishmael, \"the ruler of the house of Judah in all the king's matters\" (2 Chronicles 19:8–11). A son of Beriah (1 Chronicles 8:15). A Korhite porter of the Lord's house (1 Chronicles 26:2). Three or four others of this name are also mentioned. Zedekiah)",
